Z||000018||Capt Fiero||03-01-2000||09:06 PM||||My 85GT auto got me 240 miles at 80mph on the freeway non stop.  Long desert hwy. Fill up took 8.2 gallons I never let it get bone dry. Bad for the pump and clogs the sump filter.  That netted me 29mpg. Not bad for a V-6 auto.  I use Delco Rapid fire plugs MSD Blaster Coil and a new Delco Air Filter.  As well as a good coil new Cat.  Just did major tuneup before I left for the trip.  Oh that was using premium gas. ||||reg||1
